# Quantity Labels

## Single source of truth: `src/lib/quantityFormat.ts`

All quantity display in shop, cart, orders, and PDFs goes through this file. Never write inline `"Kit"`, `"Vials"`, `"Packung"` strings in components.

| Function | Use |
|---|---|
| `formatProductQuantity(input)` | General-purpose (resolves category, kit size, saleMode) |
| `formatCatalogQuantity(qty, categoryId, saleMode)` | Without a real kit share |
| `formatPartialKitQuantity(filled, kitSize, categoryId)` | `5/10 Kit` – only with a real `kit_share_id` |
| `formatCompleteKitCount(kitCount, categoryId, kitSize)` | `2 Kits` |
| `formatKitSplitQuantity(complete, remainder, size, cat)` | `2 Kits + 5/10 Kit` |
| `formatOrderItemQuantity(item, kitSize, saleMode)` | Orders + cart items |

## Sale mode

`saleModeForShopArea(area)` (`src/lib/shop/shopAreas.ts`):
- `"shop"` → `"retail_unit"` (Vial/Packung nouns)
- `"group_buy_1"` / `"group_buy_2"` / `null` → `"catalog"` (Kit/Vial/Packung nouns)

Always pass `saleMode` derived from the current area – never hardcode `"catalog"` in shop components.

## Price column labels: `src/lib/shop/priceLabels.ts`

`shopPriceColumnLabels(categoryId, profile)`:
- `profile = "retail"` → `"Preis / Vial"` or `"Preis / Packung"`. No bulk-tier labels.
- `profile = "group_buy"` + peptides/water → `"Preis / 10 Vials (Kit)"`, `"Preis / 10 Kits"`.
- `profile = "group_buy"` + other → `"Einzelpreis"`, `"Preis ab 10 Stück"`.

## Cart display: `src/lib/shop/cartDisplay.ts`

`cartItemQuantityLabel(item, kitSize, saleMode)` resolves category from snapshots and delegates to `quantityFormat.ts`. Do not re-implement this logic in cart components.

## Anti-patterns

- ❌ `"Preis ab 10 Vials"` in retail shop
- ❌ `"Kit"` quantity label in `/shop`
- ❌ `"5/10 Kit"` without a real `kit_share_id`
- ❌ Dividing by 10 to get a per-vial price outside `shopAreaCatalogUnit`
